WEBVTT
Kind: captions

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.960 position:63%
A special operation in El Salvador,

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:05.800 position:63%
Central America.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.400 position:63%
A show of strength staged and filmed by the government.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:16.440 position:63%
SECOT,

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.360 position:63%
the Terrorist Containment Center,

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:20.840 position:63%
has installed a high security system.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:26.400 position:63%
500 soldiers,

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:27.480 position:63%
heavily armed,

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:32.760 position:63%
are preparing to greet an unusual convoy of 2,000 ultra-dangerous prisoners.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:42.120 position:63%
These men are gang members known as Maras in El Salvador.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.680 position:63%
Straight on, straight on!

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:48.880 position:63%
Come on, come on!

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:50.560 position:63%
Murder,

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:51.640 position:63%
sexual assault,

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:52.680 position:63%
racketeering,

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.920 position:63%
these crime groups have wreaked havoc in the country for over 20 years.

00:01:05.680 --> 00:01:08.640 position:63%
Stripped to the waist in their boxer shorts with their hands tied,

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:11.240 position:63%
the whole show is designed to humiliate them.

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:22.040 position:63%
The brand new prison they are arriving at was designed especially for them.

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:26.000 position:63%
Head down!

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:31.160 position:63%
Seacolt is the largest prison in America.

00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:34.320 position:63%
Faster, faster.

00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:42.960 position:63%
Stick together!
With your heads on your friends' backs.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:48.080 position:63%
Move faster!

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:51.920 position:63%
With this footage,

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.800 position:63%
the authorities in El Salvador are
showing the country and the whole

00:01:55.840 --> 00:01:59.600 position:63%
world that they are waging a
full-scale war against these gangs.

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:06.000 position:63%
On your knees, hands out!

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:18.080 position:63%
and that they intend to lock them up in these communal cells holding up to 80 people.

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:35.720 position:63%
From

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:39.840 position:63%
now on they will live crammed together without ever receiving a single visitor.

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:48.840 position:63%
El Salvador,

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:49.960 position:63%
in Central America,

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:52.760 position:63%
is a small country of 6 million people,

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:54.560 position:63%
about the size of Brittany.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:56.080 position:63%
For 20 years,

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:58.280 position:63%
it has been the most dangerous country in the world.

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.760 position:63%
3,000 homicides a year.

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:07.800 position:63%
30 times more than in France in relation to the population.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:13.760 position:63%
El Salvador has just experienced three
of the deadiest days in its history.

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:17.520 position:63%
85 casualties were recorded throughout the country.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:18.680 position:63%
Kidnapping,

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:19.040 position:63%
murder,

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:19.840 position:63%
racketeering.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:25.760 position:63%
In my world, if I'm not wearing a gun on my belt
I feel like I'm naked.

00:03:26.160 --> 00:03:27.480 position:63%
Gangs have taken over the country,

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.240 position:63%
killing each other and terrorizing its citizens.

00:03:31.760 --> 00:03:38.080 position:63%
The Maras cut off his legs and placed them
next to his arms, while burning his entire face.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:43.440 position:63%
I heard gunfire every day, morning, noon and night.

00:03:44.560 --> 00:03:45.560 position:63%
But on June the 1st,

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:47.120 position:63%
2019,

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.760 position:63%
El Salvador's fate changed.

00:03:49.800 --> 00:03:50.520 position:63%
Nayib Bukele,

00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:51.400 position:63%
aged 37,

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:53.120 position:63%
was elected President of the Republic.

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:57.320 position:63%
The first thing we're going to do
is ensure the safety of our people.

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:02.120 position:63%
This former advertising executive declared war on gangs.

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.640 position:63%
The maras are a cancer
that we're going to eradicate.

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:10.080 position:63%
Thanks to police raids, they are now hiding like rats.
And I say this with great respect for rats.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.520 position:63%
The president is waging a relentless war against them,

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.600 position:63%
hunting them down across the country.

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.080 position:63%
As a result,

00:04:17.120 --> 00:04:19.880 position:63%
the prison population has tripled in four years.

00:04:22.000 --> 00:04:23.880 position:63%
A special penitentiary has been built.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:25.120 position:63%
The CICOT,

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.360 position:63%
the largest prison in Latin America.

00:04:28.320 --> 00:04:29.360 position:63%
Move faster!

00:04:32.160 --> 00:04:36.400 position:63%
We have armed guards on the gangways,
right above the prisoners.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:38.560 position:63%
They never take their eyes off them.

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:43.880 position:63%
In the street, population has starting to find his feet again.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:48.560 position:63%
Nowadays the maras don't come to extort me,
they're afraid to go out.

00:04:49.560 --> 00:04:51.480 position:63%
To show that his country has changed

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:55.840 position:63%
President Bukele has just organised an event parc founded

00:04:55.840 --> 00:04:57.640 position:63%
The Miss Univers contest

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:07.440 position:63%
Hi everyone, we're here at Lake Quatepeke
and look how beautiful it is!

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:11.840 position:63%
But some people are speaking out.

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:15.520 position:63%
NGOs are condemning the very strict holding conditions.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:19.760 position:63%
We need to see our families,
we haven't seen our loved ones for 10 years.

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:26.160 position:63%
Are you even going to tell me what's going on?

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:31.120 position:63%
In order to keep on meeting their targets,
the police started arresting innocent people..

00:05:31.120 --> 00:05:32.280 position:63%
an investigation

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:33.680 position:63%
Turn around!

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:36.240 position:63%
into one of the world's most oppressive countries.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.000 position:63%
Is President Bukele winning his war against the gangs?

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.560 position:63%
Is the Sikot Mega Prison really a mass deterrent to crime?

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:55.640 position:63%
To find out,

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:57.360 position:63%
we visited this extraordinary prison.

00:06:02.160 --> 00:06:04.680 position:63%
The Cicot is located in a highly controlled zone,

00:06:05.160 --> 00:06:06.520 position:63%
an hour from San Salvador,

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:07.080 position:63%
the capital.

00:06:09.320 --> 00:06:10.520 position:63%
And access is not easy.

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:12.040 position:63%
The first roadblock,

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:13.440 position:63%
manned by prison officials,

00:06:13.840 --> 00:06:15.240 position:63%
is three kilometers away.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.000 position:63%
Hello.

00:06:22.160 --> 00:06:23.200 position:63%
Your passports please?

00:06:28.560 --> 00:06:30.480 position:63%
And the phone service cuts out here?

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:34.560 position:63%
Yes, soon there won't be any signal.
Welcome, come on.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:36.360 position:63%
In fact,

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:38.160 position:63%
200 meters further on,

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:39.800 position:63%
as you approach the CICOT,

00:06:43.760 --> 00:06:44.960 position:63%
Ah yes, the network has cut out.

00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:49.280 position:63%
jammers prevent any
telephone communication

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:51.520 position:63%
within a two-kilometer
radius of the prison.

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:57.560 position:63%
The aim is to prevent gang members from ordering murders from their cells.

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:01.760 position:63%
Here we are. e
This is it.

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:05.400 position:63%
In front of us,

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:05.960 position:63%
an

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.880 position:63%
11-metre high reinforced concrete enclosure,

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.400 position:63%
capable of withstanding an attack from a tank.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.120 position:63%
Equipped with 19 watchtowers,

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:18.000 position:63%
guards armed with assault rifles and a

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:20.400 position:63%
15,000-volt electric wire fence,

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:26.080 position:63%
a technological marvel,

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.440 position:63%
a source of pride for President McKee.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:36.280 position:63%
So the government decided to mount a sophisticated communications operation.

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:40.760 position:63%
Only five television crews in the world were authorized to film,

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:42.600 position:63%
one from each continent.

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:46.880 position:63%
China.
I work for a Chinese agency.

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:50.160 position:63%
We're here for Chile.

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:54.000 position:63%
Some Australian journalists also made the journey.

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:58.240 position:63%
We are the only accredited European film group.

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:00.240 position:63%
Come on in.

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.600 position:63%
It's the director himself who acts as our guide.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:15.360 position:63%
Come along, we're going to see the detention cells.

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:20.040 position:63%
12,000 members of the MARAS are imprisoned here.

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:23.320 position:63%
Our tour begins in one of the prison's eight wings,

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:25.400 position:63%
specially reserved for gang leaders.

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:32.240 position:63%
Follow me.
Take a look.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:36.960 position:63%
Lift your t-shirts...
And line up opposite us.

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:38.480 position:63%
Which gang to you belong to?

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:40.960 position:63%
MS-13.

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.760 position:63%
And where's the other gang?

00:08:45.440 --> 00:08:47.200 position:63%
Ah, here's Barrio 18.

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.800 position:63%
These tattoos are a proof of loyalty to their gang.

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:57.760 position:63%
The number '18' represents Barrio 18,
and the letters 'MS' stand for 'Mara Salvatrucha'.

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:03.640 position:63%
18th Suriname.

00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:13.040 position:63%
The two rival gang that use to slow each other for control of the country,

00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:15.160 position:63%
 are now forced to live together.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:17.920 position:63%
But aren't there ever any fights?

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:21.680 position:63%
NO...
But that's thanks to our constant surveillance.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:26.400 position:63%
We have armed guards on the gangways,
right above the prisoners.

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:33.440 position:63%
They never let them out of their sight.
Then there's a guard in front of each cell.

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.640 position:63%
That’s around 40 orders per wing.

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:42.440 position:63%
The condition in the cell are particularly harsh.

00:09:45.800 --> 00:09:49.480 position:63%
The beds are simple metal bunks without mattresses or blankets.

00:09:52.560 --> 00:09:53.200 position:63%
And to wash,

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:57.480 position:63%
prisoners have to make do with two cement tubs filled with water.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:07.600 position:63%
They really have the bare minimum.
And there's a toilet at the side.

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:10.440 position:63%
A single toilet for 80 people,

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.240 position:63%
and there's no place for rebellion.

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:19.080 position:63%
The first prisoner to cause a problem is sent to solitary confinement,

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:21.640 position:63%
a cell measuring 3 by 2 meters,

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:22.840 position:63%
even more cramped.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.520 position:63%
This is the disciplinary cell.

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:34.640 position:63%
They have a concrete bed,
a water basin and a toilet.

00:10:35.200 --> 00:10:38.160 position:63%
The only source of light is a tiny widow in the roof

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:44.160 position:63%
The most uncooperative prisonners can spend up to 15 days in this cell.

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:53.760 position:63%
They get locked up here if there's a fight
between inmates or if they attack a guard.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:56.920 position:63%
And to contain the slaytest rebellion

00:10:58.680 --> 00:11:00.880 position:63%
s 

00:11:04.360 --> 00:11:07.320 position:63%
and the warden has prepared for anything that could happen.

00:11:08.400 --> 00:11:09.440 position:63%
Get in line!

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:12.200 position:63%
If a rebellion were to spread.

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:21.040 position:63%
Come on, I'll show you the bunker.
A separate building where we store our weapons.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:23.600 position:63%
It's essential if there's an emergency.

00:11:25.040 --> 00:11:27.680 position:63%
It's ok, they're with me.
Open the door.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:32.040 position:63%
The armory is equipped with cutting-edge assault rifles.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:41.120 position:63%
Here we have our lethal weapons,
with 5-56 calibre ammunition.

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:48.400 position:63%
We use these guns if an inmate tries to escape

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.480 position:63%
or get through the fences.

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:57.680 position:63%
And then there are the pump-action shotguns.

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:03.360 position:63%
There are two types of ammunition:
conventional bullets and rubber bullets.

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:07.360 position:63%
If we intervene inside the building,
we use rubber bullets.

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:09.320 position:63%
But that is not all.

00:12:09.880 --> 00:12:11.560 position:63%
To prevent even the smallest incident,

00:12:12.080 --> 00:12:17.320 position:63%
a network of 250 CCTV cameras scrutinizes the inmates'

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:18.400 position:63%
every move.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:23.440 position:63%
Show them how the zoom works.

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:29.040 position:63%
As far as we're concerned,
this prison is a remarkable resource.

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:31.600 position:63%
There's nothing like it in Latin America.

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:37.520 position:63%
We are on the cutting edge of technology,
and that makes our job much easier.

00:12:41.160 --> 00:12:43.080 position:63%
Despite these extreme detention conditions,

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:46.880 position:63%
Journalists over here!

00:12:49.640 --> 00:12:51.440 position:63%
The ward is keen to reassure us.

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:54.000 position:63%
And are their human rights observed here?

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:58.960 position:63%
It goes without saying,
we respect the rights of our inmates to the letter.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:01.040 position:63%
How many times a day do they eat?

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:05.600 position:63%
They receive three meals a day:
morning, noon and evening.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:09.600 position:63%
Follow me, we're going to see the food distribution.

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:14.080 position:63%
In front of our cameras,

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:16.280 position:63%
the prisoners receive their medication.

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:22.160 position:63%
and when they are allowed one hour out of their cells,

00:13:22.640 --> 00:13:24.960 position:63%
it is to sing religious hymns in unison.

00:13:30.720 --> 00:13:37.120 position:63%
The Messiah walked on water,
he walked on water.

00:13:37.280 --> 00:13:42.320 position:63%
He is here, he walks among us.

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:48.640 position:63%
It's through faith that they'll make it out.
We teach them the right values.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:53.920 position:63%
This is very important
because prisoners need something to believe in.

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:56.800 position:63%
And what better way than religion.

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.120 position:63%
To support his argument,

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:03.640 position:63%
the director has chosen a prisoner,

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:06.240 position:63%
the only one authorized to speak to us,

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.480 position:63%
a member of Barrio 18,

00:14:08.960 --> 00:14:11.800 position:63%
sentenced to 16 years in prison for extortion.

00:14:12.640 --> 00:14:19.680 position:63%
We're treated very well here..
The officers respect us.

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:23.600 position:63%
When we have a health problem, they look after us.

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:29.840 position:63%
For example, I had a skin problem on my feet
and they took me to the infirmary.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:35.520 position:63%
The cells are not overcrowded.
The CECOT is very good.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:37.680 position:63%
This man,

00:14:38.000 --> 00:14:40.640 position:63%
who can't find fault with the conditions of his detention,

00:14:41.440 --> 00:14:43.560 position:63%
used to be one of the most fearsome Maras.

00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:45.800 position:63%
As his tattoos demonstrate,

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:49.880 position:63%
only gang leaders have them on their faces.

00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:53.440 position:63%
Above his lips,

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:55.160 position:63%
the name of his clan,

00:14:55.920 --> 00:14:57.440 position:63%
the Crazy Southerners.

00:15:00.680 --> 00:15:04.120 position:63%
The tear in the corner of his eye indicates that he has committed murder.

00:15:06.480 --> 00:15:09.200 position:63%
I think we deserve a second chance.

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:10.960 position:63%
And have you changed?

00:15:11.120 --> 00:15:15.280 position:63%
Of course.
But we are only human and we were led astray.

00:15:15.440 --> 00:15:18.080 position:63%
Only God is perfect.

00:15:18.240 --> 00:15:21.360 position:63%
I ask that mothers keep an eye on their children

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:24.560 position:63%
so they don't make the same mistakes
and choose the wrong path.

00:15:25.200 --> 00:15:26.400 position:63%
That's enough!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.960 position:63%
The arranged interview is not to last more than 10 minutes.

00:15:30.480 --> 00:15:33.280 position:63%
But as soon as the guards and the warden have their back turned,

00:15:33.920 --> 00:15:35.880 position:63%
certain inmates try to get our attention.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.920 position:63%
I want to say something to the public.

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:42.000 position:63%
And their message is quite different

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.560 position:63%
There are a lot of innocent people inside here.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:48.960 position:63%
Some inmates haven't done anything wrong
and are still waiting to be sentenced.

00:15:49.120 --> 00:15:50.800 position:63%
And how long have you been here for?

00:15:50.960 --> 00:15:57.760 position:63%
For me, it's been 18 months, a really long time.
I have nothing to do with gangs.

00:15:58.560 --> 00:16:00.160 position:63%
I want to get out of here.

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:09.280 position:63%
We need to see our families, our children.
Some of us haven't seen our loved ones for 10 years.

00:16:09.440 --> 00:16:15.440 position:63%
I haven't seen my family for 4 years.
You have to help us.

00:16:16.000 --> 00:16:17.520 position:63%
No, no interviews, we're going...

00:16:20.480 --> 00:16:21.480 position:63%
The warden is annoyed.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:24.560 position:63%
Tarnishing the image of his prison is out of the question.

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:28.840 position:63%
The sea-court is far from being at its capacity.

00:16:29.480 --> 00:16:32.000 position:63%
It has room for another 28,000 maras.

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:37.920 position:63%
But President Bucali is not content with just imprisoning the members of these gangs.

00:16:38.240 --> 00:16:40.040 position:63%
He also pursues them to their death.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:44.520 position:63%
Santa Tecla Cemetery,

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:46.680 position:63%
on the outskirts of San Salvador,

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:47.280 position:63%
the capital.

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:54.560 position:63%
This is where members of the Mara Salvatrucha,

00:16:55.120 --> 00:16:56.600 position:63%
the country's most powerful gang,

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:57.200 position:63%
are buried.

00:16:58.040 --> 00:16:58.880 position:63%
The letters MS,

00:16:59.360 --> 00:17:00.880 position:63%
the symbol of their organization,

00:17:00.920 --> 00:17:03.280 position:63%
are proudly displayed on some 60 headstones.

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:10.160 position:63%
Are you ready guys?
Let's go!

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:15.120 position:63%
And today the government gave the order to carry out a crackdown.

00:17:22.680 --> 00:17:25.320 position:63%
The systematic destruction of all the tombs of the Maras.

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:31.240 position:63%
This is a first in the country's history.

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:34.000 position:63%
Let's go!
Get together.

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:35.680 position:63%
Each to their own side!

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:40.080 position:63%
The mission is entrusted to these men in Vyava,

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.280 position:63%
most of them former gang members.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.960 position:63%
The aim to erase any trace of the Maras.

00:17:54.400 --> 00:17:57.400 position:63%
and prevent the cemetery from becoming a shrine for those who remain.

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:03.000 position:63%
The scene is filmed by government cameras.

00:18:13.160 --> 00:18:15.040 position:63%
We met the cemetery manager Francisco.

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:24.080 position:63%
Here's all that's left, just little pieces of black tile.

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:26.800 position:63%
For him,

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:29.560 position:63%
the destruction of these tombs was absolutely essential.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:38.800 position:63%
We did all of this while respecting the law..
The bodies are still buried...

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:42.880 position:63%
We just destroyed the symbol of the maras.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:46.960 position:63%
Since then,

00:18:47.360 --> 00:18:49.520 position:63%
the gang families have had nowhere to gather.

00:18:52.160 --> 00:18:53.840 position:63%
Hello ladies.
- Hello.

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:55.840 position:63%
Are you looking for the tomb of a loved one?

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.080 position:63%
We can't find them.
- Who are you looking for?

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:05.560 position:63%
Two women soon realize that the tombs of the Maras have been destroyed.

00:19:06.520 --> 00:19:07.760 position:63%
And they start to get scared.

00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:10.640 position:63%
Was a member of your family buried here?

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:14.560 position:63%
No, I don't know anyone buried here.

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.240 position:63%
They say no more and leave the cemetery in a hurry.

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:22.800 position:63%
But Francisco is not fooled.

00:19:23.280 --> 00:19:28.880 position:63%
If you noticed,
the lady in black wouldn't even look at me.

00:19:29.280 --> 00:19:31.040 position:63%
She was stressed.

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:34.080 position:63%
It's a sign that she was looking
for the grave of a gang member.

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:39.360 position:63%
When they saw me coming, they got scared.

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:45.120 position:63%
You know, at the moment it's dangerous
to have anything to do with the maras.

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:46.240 position:63%
These women

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:48.840 position:63%
could be identified and arrested by the police.

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:55.560 position:63%
But Francisco doesn't feel sorry for them or their deceased loved ones.

00:19:58.640 --> 00:20:00.720 position:63%
You might think that destroying their graves
is excessive.

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:09.280 position:63%
But the real excess was before,
when the maras made us suffer.

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:14.400 position:63%
My children couldn't go out to play
without being threatened.

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:16.880 position:63%
They were at risk of being killed.

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:21.520 position:63%
I have relatives who lost their lives
for no good reason.

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:29.520 position:63%
I think that destroying the symbols of the maras
is a huge step forward for our country.

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:33.600 position:63%
20,000 Maras are still thought to be at large.

00:20:35.320 --> 00:20:37.400 position:63%
So the authorities are not letting up the pressure.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:40.600 position:63%
The police are hunting them down relentlessly.

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:46.280 position:63%
Soyapango,

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:48.280 position:63%
El Salvador's second largest city,

00:20:49.960 --> 00:20:52.440 position:63%
the last stronghold of the Barrio 18 gang.

00:20:53.240 --> 00:20:53.720 position:63%
This morning,

00:20:54.240 --> 00:20:56.880 position:63%
4,000 soldiers and police surrounded the site.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:00.720 position:63%
Come on!
Hurry up!

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:03.480 position:63%
Their aim,

00:21:04.040 --> 00:21:06.120 position:63%
to capture the last remaining Maras,

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:07.960 position:63%
hiding among the locals.

00:21:10.320 --> 00:21:13.560 position:63%
No vehicle can enter or leave the city without being checked.

00:21:18.400 --> 00:21:22.160 position:63%
Hello, switch off the ignition.

00:21:23.120 --> 00:21:25.200 position:63%
Your identification please.

00:21:25.360 --> 00:21:28.000 position:63%
Yours and your colleague's behind you.

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:31.760 position:63%
But the police don't just check vehicles,

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:33.200 position:63%
they also search every house.

00:21:34.680 --> 00:21:35.240 position:63%
For years,

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:37.400 position:63%
gangs have threatened
to kill residents who

00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:39.480 position:63%
don't agree to let them
squat in their homes.

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:42.720 position:63%
Hello...

00:21:44.880 --> 00:21:46.880 position:63%
And some Maras still live there.

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:52.880 position:63%
Do you live here?
Can you show me the deed to the property?

00:21:54.480 --> 00:22:00.000 position:63%
Here it is!
This deed shows that this lady is the owner.

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:07.360 position:63%
This allows us to check that the house has not been
occupied by people who have no business here...

00:22:07.520 --> 00:22:09.120 position:63%
There's nothing to report about this house.

00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:12.080 position:63%
Thank you, goodbye.

00:22:14.520 --> 00:22:16.680 position:63%
So the police also check passers-by.

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:20.000 position:63%
They ask people to lift their t-shirts.

00:22:20.080 --> 00:22:21.120 position:63%
Turn around.

00:22:21.920 --> 00:22:23.760 position:63%
because they're on the hunt for tattoos,

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:25.320 position:63%
the Maris'

00:22:25.480 --> 00:22:26.640 position:63%
identification system.

00:22:27.720 --> 00:22:30.800 position:63%
Every passerby must explain their tattoos,

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:34.480 position:63%
That's my daughter's name.
Katia.

00:22:35.560 --> 00:22:37.480 position:63%
whether it's the name of someone close to them,

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:39.640 position:63%
or just a decorative design.

00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:47.360 position:63%
I have a flower on my chest
and five stars on my back.

00:22:48.800 --> 00:22:51.280 position:63%
We'll take a look at your record in the files.

00:22:59.120 --> 00:22:59.800 position:63%
but this one,

00:22:59.960 --> 00:23:01.840 position:63%
covered in obvious gang tattoos,

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:04.560 position:63%
is quickly taken away.

00:23:04.560 --> 00:23:05.600 position:63%
Turn around.

00:23:07.480 --> 00:23:10.160 position:63%
Since Nayib Bukele came to power four years ago,

00:23:10.760 --> 00:23:14.000 position:63%
the police have captured more than 75,000 gang members.

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:23.760 position:63%
These arrests were widely reported on the young president's social networks.

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:29.120 position:63%
The guarantor of this highly punitive policy is the president's right-hand man.

00:23:30.200 --> 00:23:32.160 position:63%
His name is Gustavo Villatoro,

00:23:32.680 --> 00:23:35.840 position:63%
and he is El Salvador's Minister of Justice and Public Security.

00:23:36.360 --> 00:23:39.880 position:63%
He agreed to meet us and dressed up in his military uniform for the occasion,

00:23:40.440 --> 00:23:42.920 position:63%
declaring his support
for the anti-Marras War

00:23:42.960 --> 00:23:45.440 position:63%
he has been waging
for the past two years.

00:23:47.680 --> 00:23:53.440 position:63%
We're fighting a criminal organisation that has been
preying on this country for over 20 years.

00:23:53.840 --> 00:23:56.480 position:63%
And we're going to destroy every last one of them!

00:23:57.600 --> 00:24:02.880 position:63%
In 2015, we were sadly known
as the most violent country in the world

00:24:03.040 --> 00:24:06.240 position:63%
with 105 murders per 100,000 inhabitants

00:24:06.800 --> 00:24:13.040 position:63%
And last year that figure dropped to just under 8.
And that's thanks to the exceptional state!

00:24:15.120 --> 00:24:17.920 position:63%
So how much longer is this going to go on?

00:24:19.200 --> 00:24:27.040 position:63%
Until we have captured the last member
of these criminal organisations still at large.

00:24:28.040 --> 00:24:28.880 position:63%
In his office,

00:24:28.880 --> 00:24:32.160 position:63%
the minister has an unstoppable weapon against the Maras.

00:24:32.160 --> 00:24:32.200 position:63%
Oh,

00:24:34.960 --> 00:24:41.040 position:63%
In here are all the tattoos...all of them!
And we know the meaning of each of them.

00:24:41.360 --> 00:24:45.280 position:63%
Look, here you have the membership symbol
of the terrorist group, MS,

00:24:45.440 --> 00:24:49.600 position:63%
and underneath it is the name of the clan
to which the person belongs.

00:24:49.840 --> 00:24:54.960 position:63%
No-one can come along and say
"Oh no, it's just an artistic tattoo".

00:24:55.120 --> 00:24:59.040 position:63%
We know our targets!
We know exactly who the terrorists are. 5.110

00:24:59.880 --> 00:25:01.640 position:63%
In the face of the government's persistence,

00:25:02.040 --> 00:25:04.760 position:63%
20,000 Maras have already fled the country.

00:25:09.680 --> 00:25:13.000 position:63%
We found one of these fugitives on the outskirts of Mexico City,

00:25:13.520 --> 00:25:15.600 position:63%
2,000 kilometers from El Salvador.

00:25:17.080 --> 00:25:18.160 position:63%
A former hitman,

00:25:18.480 --> 00:25:19.840 position:63%
he has found refuge here,

00:25:20.240 --> 00:25:21.360 position:63%
far from his homeland.

00:25:22.840 --> 00:25:25.160 position:63%
He lives in this small house with his partner.

00:25:25.520 --> 00:25:27.680 position:63%
who is Mexican and eight months pregnant.

00:25:28.800 --> 00:25:31.640 position:63%
The man agreed to meet us but he wishes to remain anonymous.

00:25:31.720 --> 00:25:32.680 position:63%
We'll call him Carlos.

00:25:34.160 --> 00:25:42.400 position:63%
I'm very happy here, our baby is due in a few weeks.
It's such a blessing.

00:25:44.400 --> 00:25:48.320 position:63%
Family is very important to me.

00:25:49.080 --> 00:25:49.920 position:63%
For 30 years,

00:25:49.960 --> 00:25:52.800 position:63%
Carlos was part of the notorious Mara Salvatrucha,

00:25:53.320 --> 00:25:55.440 position:63%
a gang he joined at the age of 13.

00:25:55.880 --> 00:25:58.120 position:63%
He was what is referred to as a soldier,

00:25:58.600 --> 00:25:59.120 position:63%
in other words,

00:25:59.120 --> 00:26:02.560 position:63%
a lackey who killed and extorted by the instruction of the gang leaders.

00:26:06.480 --> 00:26:11.440 position:63%
In my world, if I'm not wearing a gun on my belt
I feel like I'm naked.

00:26:12.240 --> 00:26:17.120 position:63%
There were a lot of clashes with rival gangs.
You had to shoot to kill.

00:26:17.280 --> 00:26:19.760 position:63%
It was a question of survival.

00:26:22.080 --> 00:26:25.280 position:63%
Kill or be killed?
Yeah, exactly.

00:26:28.800 --> 00:26:29.760 position:63%
Look.

00:26:29.920 --> 00:26:35.280 position:63%
During a fight with "Barrio 18",
I was stabbed with a piece of scrap metal.

00:26:36.320 --> 00:26:40.000 position:63%
It had been sharpened to penetrate the flesh
and pierce my lungs.

00:26:41.920 --> 00:26:43.800 position:63%
Carlos miraculously survived.

00:26:44.520 --> 00:26:47.040 position:63%
After seven days suspended between life and death,

00:26:47.480 --> 00:26:50.760 position:63%
he pulled through and immediately resumed his role in the gang.

00:26:53.600 --> 00:26:59.120 position:63%
I managed a trading point.
We made around 15,000 dollars a month.

00:27:02.480 --> 00:27:07.520 position:63%
And to make even more money,
the gang started to shake down shopkeepers.

00:27:09.360 --> 00:27:11.920 position:63%
We were stealing up to 70,000 dollars
a month from them.

00:27:12.640 --> 00:27:16.000 position:63%
And those who didn't pay, we simply killed them.

00:27:17.080 --> 00:27:17.560 position:63%
Nonetheless,

00:27:17.560 --> 00:27:21.760 position:63%
he ended up being arrested by the police and spent 16 years in prison,

00:27:22.200 --> 00:27:24.320 position:63%
where he was tattooed all over his body.

00:27:26.320 --> 00:27:33.520 position:63%
In the gang, getting tattooed was a point of pride.
It shows other people they have to respect us.

00:27:34.960 --> 00:27:39.120 position:63%
I even have them on my eyelids.
I did it thinking about the day I'd die.

00:27:39.840 --> 00:27:43.680 position:63%
With my eyes closed,
everyone would know who I was.

00:27:46.160 --> 00:27:46.840 position:63%
But these days,

00:27:47.200 --> 00:27:49.640 position:63%
having these tattoos has become dangerous.

00:27:51.400 --> 00:27:53.600 position:63%
They are the symbol of gang membership.

00:27:55.360 --> 00:27:57.360 position:63%
If Mexican police officers discover them,

00:27:57.400 --> 00:27:59.120 position:63%
they could send him back to El Salvador.

00:28:00.640 --> 00:28:01.680 position:63%
Yes?

00:28:02.240 --> 00:28:04.880 position:63%
Hello, I'm here for a session.

00:28:05.360 --> 00:28:08.080 position:63%
Ok, I'm coming.
- Thank you.

00:28:09.520 --> 00:28:11.640 position:63%
So Carlos is fixated on one thing,

00:28:12.160 --> 00:28:12.960 position:63%
removing them.

00:28:13.920 --> 00:28:15.760 position:63%
He has already had 11 appointments.

00:28:16.960 --> 00:28:20.080 position:63%
This way, please, you can sit down.
- Thank you.

00:28:20.200 --> 00:28:24.040 position:63%
Each time he goes to a different clinic to avoid being identified.

00:28:26.000 --> 00:28:28.560 position:63%
I'm going to play some music.

00:28:30.280 --> 00:28:32.320 position:63%
It's the first time he's come to see Maria.

00:28:35.440 --> 00:28:39.200 position:63%
This is me before, with all my tattoos.

00:28:40.640 --> 00:28:43.280 position:63%
You can see the black ink on my forehead.

00:28:44.880 --> 00:28:49.440 position:63%
I had them everywhere.
Just black, black everywhere.

00:28:50.240 --> 00:28:53.280 position:63%
And this is now.
You can see the change.

00:29:02.000 --> 00:29:04.480 position:63%
Your face is the first thing that people see.

00:29:04.960 --> 00:29:08.800 position:63%
And with these tattoos
I'm immediately associated with the gangs.

00:29:09.120 --> 00:29:12.720 position:63%
But how do you get the ink in prison?

00:29:12.880 --> 00:29:17.280 position:63%
We made it ourselves,
with disposable razors like this one.

00:29:18.480 --> 00:29:19.680 position:63%
We burned it.

00:29:20.080 --> 00:29:24.640 position:63%
Then we added shampoo,
and that made a sort of homemade ink.

00:29:26.000 --> 00:29:27.280 position:63%
And for the needle?

00:29:27.440 --> 00:29:30.960 position:63%
We'd use the thinnest wire string from a guitar.

00:29:33.840 --> 00:29:37.120 position:63%
Are you ready to be tortured?
Let's go.

00:29:37.360 --> 00:29:40.960 position:63%
Get comfortable.
I'm going to turn the machine on.

00:29:41.360 --> 00:29:42.800 position:63%
She's called Morticia.

00:29:44.320 --> 00:29:45.520 position:63%
I'm stressed...

00:29:49.240 --> 00:29:52.840 position:63%
Maria uses a laser to pulverize the ink pigments one by one.

00:29:56.880 --> 00:29:57.920 position:63%
There, that hurts.

00:30:01.120 --> 00:30:02.240 position:63%
especially on the face,

00:30:02.280 --> 00:30:03.840 position:63%
an area full of nerve endings.

00:30:05.280 --> 00:30:12.160 position:63%
The pain is unbearable.
I have an awful burning sensation.

00:30:13.280 --> 00:30:16.400 position:63%
I'm trying not to think about it.
Otherwise I can't stand it.

00:30:17.920 --> 00:30:19.920 position:63%
But it's worth it.

00:30:21.600 --> 00:30:21.720 position:63%
The

00:30:21.760 --> 00:30:23.160 position:63%
ordeal will last an hour and a half.

00:30:26.000 --> 00:30:27.840 position:63%
I'm going to do the chin now.

00:30:29.720 --> 00:30:31.920 position:63%
Almost 2500 lazer chock in total.

00:30:32.840 --> 00:30:34.120 position:63%
A record for Maria.

00:30:34.400 --> 00:30:38.240 position:63%
I usually do 150 in one session.

00:30:41.120 --> 00:30:43.680 position:63%
But Carlos is in hurry to remove his tattoos.

00:30:43.960 --> 00:30:46.160 position:63%
Even if it mean enduring the pain.

00:30:47.280 --> 00:30:50.960 position:63%
Here, it's starting to swell.
You've been brave!

00:30:52.160 --> 00:30:53.600 position:63%
It hurts everywhere.

00:30:53.760 --> 00:30:57.440 position:63%
Around my neck, on my head...
but I'm very happy.

00:30:58.680 --> 00:31:01.240 position:63%
The former assassin is greatful for Maria’s work,

00:31:01.720 --> 00:31:03.080 position:63%
but also for her discretion.

00:31:04.480 --> 00:31:06.560 position:63%
This session could have cost him his freedom.

00:31:08.640 --> 00:31:13.200 position:63%
Thank you for not calling the police,
someone already did that to me in El Salvador.

00:31:14.000 --> 00:31:15.680 position:63%
And you've really done a great job.

00:31:18.320 --> 00:31:22.560 position:63%
From the bottom of my heart,
it's been a pleasure to help you.

00:31:23.200 --> 00:31:25.120 position:63%
I'll show you out.
- Thank you very much.

00:31:25.280 --> 00:31:26.240 position:63%
You're welcome.

00:31:26.560 --> 00:31:30.400 position:63%
Carlos still has to endure half a dozen sessions to remove his tattoos.

00:31:36.160 --> 00:31:40.760 position:63%
He then hopes to return to his country to lead a normal life away from the gangs.

00:31:44.200 --> 00:31:45.160 position:63%
Back to El Salvador.

00:31:47.160 --> 00:31:49.080 position:63%
Since Nayib Bukele came to power,

00:31:49.520 --> 00:31:51.320 position:63%
peace has been restored in the country.

00:31:53.040 --> 00:31:54.200 position:63%
Like here in Las Cañas,

00:31:54.600 --> 00:31:57.080 position:63%
a middle-class neighborhood on the outskirts of the capital.

00:31:59.400 --> 00:31:59.800 position:63%
All over,

00:31:59.920 --> 00:32:01.520 position:63%
gangs were reigning supreme.

00:32:04.320 --> 00:32:05.120 position:63%
For a long time,

00:32:05.520 --> 00:32:07.040 position:63%
this playground remained empty.

00:32:09.120 --> 00:32:13.840 position:63%
Come on kids, we're going back.
Just a bit further.

00:32:14.720 --> 00:32:14.960 position:63%
Here,

00:32:15.360 --> 00:32:16.840 position:63%
the gangs would spread terror.

00:32:17.520 --> 00:32:20.640 position:63%
So much so that the children no longer dared to go to school.

00:32:21.120 --> 00:32:26.400 position:63%
Today's lesson is on Pythagoras' theorem.
Can someone tell me who this man was?

00:32:27.560 --> 00:32:29.560 position:63%
Don Pedro, aged 60,

00:32:29.560 --> 00:32:31.320 position:63%
He's been a teacher for around 20 years.

00:32:32.200 --> 00:32:35.560 position:63%
This maths lesson was unimaginable just two years ago.

00:32:36.400 --> 00:32:40.640 position:63%
At one point, I only had three or five pupils.

00:32:45.040 --> 00:32:47.840 position:63%
None of the parents wanted
to send their children to school,

00:32:48.000 --> 00:32:51.520 position:63%
because they were at risk
of being mugged by thugs on the way.

00:32:55.680 --> 00:32:57.840 position:63%
We had a problem with attendance.

00:32:59.880 --> 00:33:03.960 position:63%
Here, all the people has experience violence because of the Marras.

00:33:06.880 --> 00:33:12.160 position:63%
When the police were chasing the maras around
the neighbourhood, it was very dangerous,

00:33:12.320 --> 00:33:15.440 position:63%
you could find yourself in the middle of a gunfight.

00:33:22.080 --> 00:33:24.080 position:63%
In fact, that's what happened to me.

00:33:24.240 --> 00:33:28.480 position:63%
My mother shielded me with her body
so that I wouldn't get shot.

00:33:31.720 --> 00:33:33.880 position:63%
This school was at the heart of a turf war.

00:33:35.440 --> 00:33:37.840 position:63%
See you tomorrow!
Be on time!

00:33:39.480 --> 00:33:40.160 position:63%
In this area,

00:33:40.280 --> 00:33:42.760 position:63%
gangs fought over every street with guns and knives.

00:33:45.760 --> 00:33:46.240 position:63%
On average,

00:33:46.560 --> 00:33:48.800 position:63%
three murders were committed every month.

00:33:53.120 --> 00:34:00.000 position:63%
Each gang controlled a part of the district.
And now we're approaching the imaginary border.

00:34:00.160 --> 00:34:05.360 position:63%
There wasn't really a dividing line.
Here it is.

00:34:10.000 --> 00:34:12.440 position:63%
A border that divided the neighborhood in two.

00:34:13.840 --> 00:34:14.360 position:63%
On the left,

00:34:14.760 --> 00:34:16.560 position:63%
the territory of Barrio 18.

00:34:17.480 --> 00:34:17.960 position:63%
On the right,

00:34:18.400 --> 00:34:19.960 position:63%
that of the Mara Salvatrucha.

00:34:22.480 --> 00:34:26.800 position:63%
Crossing that line was suicide, you'd get killed.

00:34:27.920 --> 00:34:32.320 position:63%
And some parts of the district
still bear the scars of this gang war.

00:34:35.760 --> 00:34:39.440 position:63%
Look at the bullet holes on the wall.

00:34:39.600 --> 00:34:41.920 position:63%
They bear witness to the violence in which we lived.

00:34:43.840 --> 00:34:45.440 position:63%
It was a warzone?

00:34:45.600 --> 00:34:50.080 position:63%
Yes, absolutely.
Not a day went by without gunfire.

00:34:50.240 --> 00:34:56.400 position:63%
I heard gunfire every day.
Morning, noon and night.

00:34:57.600 --> 00:34:58.680 position:63%
In this merciless war,

00:34:59.160 --> 00:35:01.680 position:63%
some of the residents have paid a high price.

00:35:02.080 --> 00:35:02.840 position:63%
A few months ago,

00:35:03.920 --> 00:35:06.600 position:63%
62-year-old Rafaela lost her nephew Miguel,

00:35:06.960 --> 00:35:09.400 position:63%
who was killed by Maras trying to steal his car.

00:35:09.840 --> 00:35:13.600 position:63%
My nephew was like a son to me.

00:35:15.280 --> 00:35:21.520 position:63%
One day, he went out at 6am
and was never seen again.

00:35:23.920 --> 00:35:30.160 position:63%
A month later,
the police found his decomposing body.

00:35:32.400 --> 00:35:37.600 position:63%
The maras had cut off his legs
and put them in place of his arms.

00:35:39.440 --> 00:35:41.680 position:63%
They had also burnt his entire face.

00:35:44.840 --> 00:35:46.240 position:63%
Miguel was the family's hope.

00:35:47.600 --> 00:35:49.600 position:63%
The only one to have made it through university.

00:35:52.960 --> 00:35:55.360 position:63%
He had just qualified as a lawyer.

00:35:58.920 --> 00:36:02.640 position:63%
The state of terror is such that the courts have closed the case,

00:36:03.400 --> 00:36:05.880 position:63%
much to the despair of Miguel's father.

00:36:08.000 --> 00:36:12.560 position:63%
I've got used to living with this pain
in the depths of my being.

00:36:14.320 --> 00:36:18.080 position:63%
There's nothing I can do about it.
I'm totally powerless.

00:36:20.080 --> 00:36:24.240 position:63%
I thank our President for everything he's doing.

00:36:24.400 --> 00:36:28.160 position:63%
With his security policy, my son might still be alive.

00:36:33.000 --> 00:36:34.440 position:63%
And today I am happy,

00:36:34.800 --> 00:36:39.400 position:63%
because of what the president is doing,

00:36:43.240 --> 00:36:47.000 position:63%
to implement the policies of that judge.

00:36:47.080 --> 00:36:48.680 position:63%
My son would be alive.

00:36:50.280 --> 00:36:51.040 position:63%
in the stands,

00:36:51.360 --> 00:36:52.440 position:63%
children and families.

00:36:55.040 --> 00:36:58.280 position:63%
Joyful scenes that were unimaginable just a few months ago.

00:36:59.120 --> 00:37:03.440 position:63%
It was impossible to set foot here,
to come and watch a football match.

00:37:03.600 --> 00:37:05.280 position:63%
We had to play amongst ourselves.

00:37:05.440 --> 00:37:08.400 position:63%
But since the start of the tournament
I've been coming here a lot.

00:37:08.440 --> 00:37:10.000 position:63%
To keep the football matches going,

00:37:10.080 --> 00:37:12.720 position:63%
the authorities are not
letting up the pressure

00:37:12.720 --> 00:37:15.320 position:63%
and are continuing to
hunt down every last Mara.

00:37:21.040 --> 00:37:21.840 position:63%
In Soyopango,

00:37:22.320 --> 00:37:24.120 position:63%
the police are still out in force.

00:37:25.640 --> 00:37:28.400 position:63%
An elite unit has even been called in to reinforce them,

00:37:28.840 --> 00:37:31.480 position:63%
and today they have a very specific target in mind.

00:37:33.360 --> 00:37:36.520 position:63%
A woman suspected of working for the gangs.

00:37:37.160 --> 00:37:38.400 position:63%
According to their intelligence,

00:37:38.760 --> 00:37:40.960 position:63%
she is linked to the Mara Salvatrucha,

00:37:43.200 --> 00:37:45.160 position:63%
a dangerous operation for these soldiers.

00:37:46.720 --> 00:37:50.960 position:63%
Members of the maras are not afraid of death.
They don't let anything happen to them.

00:37:53.200 --> 00:37:57.200 position:63%
They either shoot at us to escape,
or are killed by our bullets.

00:37:59.280 --> 00:38:02.320 position:63%
I've made so many arrests that I've lost count.

00:38:06.600 --> 00:38:09.120 position:63%
Since the state of emergency was declared two years ago,

00:38:09.680 --> 00:38:12.440 position:63%
the intervention squads have had full jurisdiction.

00:38:13.000 --> 00:38:16.240 position:63%
They do not even need a judge's warrant to arrest a suspect.

00:38:19.920 --> 00:38:21.440 position:63%
Hello.
We're looking for Mrs Martinez?

00:38:21.640 --> 00:38:25.200 position:63%
Yes, that's my mother.
- Where is she?

00:38:25.760 --> 00:38:27.920 position:63%
At school, but she's coming.

00:38:32.160 --> 00:38:33.800 position:63%
This is the woman they're looking for,

00:38:34.360 --> 00:38:35.640 position:63%
one of the town school teachers.

00:38:38.480 --> 00:38:39.520 position:63%
Hello.

00:38:40.400 --> 00:38:43.440 position:63%
 was at school.
I've left the children with the supervisor.

00:38:44.320 --> 00:38:48.320 position:63%
OK, we're going to ask you to come with us
to clear something up.

00:38:53.200 --> 00:38:54.720 position:63%
What's going on?

00:38:54.880 --> 00:38:58.400 position:63%
Because the police already came by yesterday
to check the house's papers.

00:39:00.480 --> 00:39:04.280 position:63%
The police are no longer obliged to explain the real reasons for her arrest.

00:39:07.840 --> 00:39:12.000 position:63%
It's just an administrative procedure, Madam.
Will you come with us?

00:39:12.480 --> 00:39:13.840 position:63%
Thank you for your cooperation.

00:39:15.000 --> 00:39:16.640 position:63%
In El Salvator,

00:39:16.640 --> 00:39:19.560 position:63%
this is all you need to arrest a suspect.

00:39:20.800 --> 00:39:24.280 position:63%
On it, just the identity adress.

00:39:25.080 --> 00:39:26.080 position:63%
And the charge.

00:39:26.480 --> 00:39:30.000 position:63%
But are you going to tell me what's going on?!

00:39:30.800 --> 00:39:34.240 position:63%
I'm going to handcuff you.
- What the hell?! I haven't done anything.

00:39:41.680 --> 00:39:43.920 position:63%
The teacher is taken to the local police station,

00:39:46.880 --> 00:39:50.040 position:63%
but once there her arrest takes an unexpected turn.

00:39:51.440 --> 00:39:52.960 position:63%
Who's in charge of this file?

00:39:54.520 --> 00:39:56.720 position:63%
A policewoman asks us to stop filming.

00:39:56.720 --> 00:40:00.320 position:63%
You're coming with me, get out!
You have to wait for the procedure to be completed.

00:40:04.720 --> 00:40:08.160 position:63%
One of the officers noticed inconsistencies in the suspect's file.

00:40:11.120 --> 00:40:14.880 position:63%
Look, the lady lives in an area
controlled by "Barrio 18",

00:40:15.040 --> 00:40:20.240 position:63%
but in your file it says that she's collaborating
with the other gang, MS.

00:40:20.480 --> 00:40:21.600 position:63%
This can't be true.

00:40:22.840 --> 00:40:24.440 position:63%
But there's another mistake on the card.

00:40:27.520 --> 00:40:33.920 position:63%
Boss, it says on the card that she's a shopkeeper,
but here at the station we know her well,

00:40:34.080 --> 00:40:35.440 position:63%
she's a school teacher.

00:40:36.240 --> 00:40:37.600 position:63%
You don't know the first thing about it!

00:40:37.760 --> 00:40:39.920 position:63%
We've arrested her,
now we have to continue the procedure.

00:40:42.640 --> 00:40:49.280 position:63%
But the local policeman has his doubt, he doesn't want to commit a miscarriage of justice so he insist.

00:40:49.760 --> 00:40:54.640 position:63%
Look, my men are just going to take her
to the detectives, all right?

00:40:54.800 --> 00:41:02.160 position:63%
Be careful, he's got a camera on him...
Yes, yes, I saw... I'm not signing the warrant!

00:41:03.960 --> 00:41:06.400 position:63%
There were at least two errors in the file,

00:41:06.920 --> 00:41:10.440 position:63%
but the teacher was taken in anyway to be presented to the investigators.

00:41:13.360 --> 00:41:13.880 position:63%
Her sister,

00:41:14.200 --> 00:41:15.880 position:63%
who has just arrived at the police station,

00:41:16.400 --> 00:41:17.200 position:63%
is in shock.

00:41:17.200 --> 00:41:17.760 position:63%
She has a lot of blood.

00:41:19.200 --> 00:41:24.560 position:63%
She has nothing to do with gangs.
She's been a teacher for a very long time.

00:41:24.800 --> 00:41:29.200 position:63%
I don't understand why she was arrested.
She's an honest, hard-working person.

00:41:29.440 --> 00:41:32.080 position:63%
Do you think it's an error?
- Obviously.

00:41:33.840 --> 00:41:34.800 position:63%
Guilty or not,

00:41:35.160 --> 00:41:38.000 position:63%
the teacher could remain in prison for two years,

00:41:39.440 --> 00:41:43.080 position:63%
the maximum legal period before a first hearing.

00:41:45.560 --> 00:41:46.400 position:63%
In El Salvador,

00:41:46.440 --> 00:41:47.640 position:63%
arrests are made first,

00:41:47.760 --> 00:41:48.600 position:63%
then investigated,

00:41:49.080 --> 00:41:52.320 position:63%
a procedure that one man has dared to denounce.

00:41:55.760 --> 00:41:59.000 position:63%
Marvin has worked as a police officer for almost 20 years.

00:41:59.520 --> 00:42:02.240 position:63%
He is now denouncing arbitrary arrests,

00:42:02.760 --> 00:42:05.240 position:63%
allegedly due to quotas imposed by the government,

00:42:06.720 --> 00:42:09.800 position:63%
which demanded 1,000 arrests a day throughout the country.

00:42:10.760 --> 00:42:13.040 position:63%
Marvin shows us an exclusive document.

00:42:14.080 --> 00:42:18.640 position:63%
That's the number of arrests we had to make
in each neighbourhood.

00:42:18.800 --> 00:42:26.400 position:63%
In San Salvador, 40 a day,
San Marco, 20, Soyapango 40..

00:42:26.640 --> 00:42:29.840 position:63%
That's a lot, and in all,
175 people had to be arrested.

00:42:30.920 --> 00:42:32.040 position:63%
To motivate their troops,

00:42:32.520 --> 00:42:34.200 position:63%
the authorities used blackmail.

00:42:36.240 --> 00:42:37.680 position:63%
If the targets were not met,

00:42:38.040 --> 00:42:41.040 position:63%
the police officers were not allowed to go home to see their families.

00:42:45.600 --> 00:42:49.440 position:63%
Many of the arrests had nothing to do with gangs,

00:42:49.680 --> 00:42:54.000 position:63%
because at some point all the criminals
had deserted the streets.

00:42:54.240 --> 00:42:59.440 position:63%
Look at this young man, for example.
He's working, making sandwiches.

00:42:59.600 --> 00:43:02.880 position:63%
If a patrol came by, they'd head straight for him,

00:43:03.040 --> 00:43:06.080 position:63%
check him out and take him straight
to the police station.

00:43:06.720 --> 00:43:12.480 position:63%
Once there, he was told that he was being detained
on suspicion of being a maras.

00:43:16.040 --> 00:43:20.240 position:63%
Marvin Resign, 3 years ago disgusted by this practices,

00:43:20.240 --> 00:43:23.840 position:63%
 he joins a union that denounces the exces of the police.

00:43:27.360 --> 00:43:35.040 position:63%
Our hope is that the police will be able to act fairly,
respecting the constitution and human rights,

00:43:35.200 --> 00:43:38.400 position:63%
and that innocent people will not suffer.

00:43:39.120 --> 00:43:43.200 position:63%
But by denouncing these excesses,
we run a real risk.

00:43:43.360 --> 00:43:50.720 position:63%
We have received death threats
from people affiliated to the government.

00:43:53.440 --> 00:43:57.840 position:63%
But does this policy of making arrests at all costs lead the police to make mistakes?

00:44:02.840 --> 00:44:06.760 position:63%
An hour west of San Salvador lies the small town of Quezaltepeca.

00:44:10.880 --> 00:44:12.720 position:63%
Girls, let's eat!

00:44:14.240 --> 00:44:18.160 position:63%
This is where Maribel lives with her three children.

00:44:20.880 --> 00:44:24.800 position:63%
Pasta and fried rice.
Does that sound nice?

00:44:27.440 --> 00:44:28.200 position:63%
Eighteen months ago,

00:44:28.400 --> 00:44:29.680 position:63%
tragedy struck the family.

00:44:31.240 --> 00:44:31.520 position:63%
Jorge,

00:44:31.600 --> 00:44:32.320 position:63%
the eldest son,

00:44:32.400 --> 00:44:33.120 position:63%
was put in prison.

00:44:36.560 --> 00:44:41.920 position:63%
These are all the books I bought him.
He wanted to be a teacher.

00:44:42.080 --> 00:44:45.920 position:63%
I was so proud that day,
the proudest mother in the world.

00:44:46.240 --> 00:44:50.320 position:63%
That was the day he graduated for the first time,
in English.

00:44:51.920 --> 00:44:54.320 position:63%
It's hard to look at that photo.

00:44:55.840 --> 00:44:57.120 position:63%
I don't know what they are doing to me.

00:44:57.120 --> 00:44:58.000 position:63%
Outside his studies,

00:44:58.160 --> 00:45:00.520 position:63%
Jorge worked as a bricklayer to feed the family.

00:45:01.800 --> 00:45:04.960 position:63%
It was on his way home from a building site that he was arrested.

00:45:05.760 --> 00:45:10.240 position:63%
When the police took him away,
my heart broke into a million pieces.

00:45:10.400 --> 00:45:12.960 position:63%
But I didn't cry in front of him.

00:45:13.120 --> 00:45:18.560 position:63%
I told him: be brave!
I'll move mountains to get you released.

00:45:21.680 --> 00:45:23.520 position:63%
Gran, would you like some beans?

00:45:24.880 --> 00:45:27.680 position:63%
The authorities suspect Jorge of being part of a gang.

00:45:28.640 --> 00:45:31.760 position:63%
Is there any proof?
- No, nothing at all.

00:45:31.920 --> 00:45:39.920 position:63%
My son was arrested to fill a quota.
The policeman at the station told me.

00:45:40.320 --> 00:45:48.160 position:63%
He needed one more person to fill his quota.
Unfortunately my son was one of them.

00:45:50.280 --> 00:45:50.760 position:63%
his arrest,

00:45:50.760 --> 00:45:52.240 position:63%
the family has been devastated.

00:45:53.440 --> 00:46:00.960 position:63%
Look, there's Jorge and there's me.
And this is a heart.

00:46:01.120 --> 00:46:05.920 position:63%
A heart because we miss him.
And we love him a lot.

00:46:06.080 --> 00:46:12.400 position:63%
He's a very good brother.
He looked after us a lot.

00:46:12.560 --> 00:46:15.680 position:63%
I'm afraid that something
will happen to him in prison

00:46:15.840 --> 00:46:18.160 position:63%
and that I'Il never be able
to hold him in my arms again.

00:46:18.320 --> 00:46:20.640 position:63%
Because I love him so much.

00:46:22.080 --> 00:46:23.320 position:63%
Before her son's arrest,

00:46:23.680 --> 00:46:25.280 position:63%
Mary-Belle ran a grocery shop.

00:46:28.560 --> 00:46:30.560 position:63%
I can still smell his scent

00:46:31.360 --> 00:46:32.720 position:63%
See you later.

00:46:33.960 --> 00:46:34.400 position:63%
Since then,

00:46:34.840 --> 00:46:37.440 position:63%
she has sold everything to try to get him out of prison.

00:46:39.440 --> 00:46:42.720 position:63%
Every evening she travels to the San Salvador detention center,

00:46:43.200 --> 00:46:44.360 position:63%
an hour's drive away.

00:46:48.360 --> 00:46:51.400 position:63%
Around 20 detainees are released every night at around

00:46:51.840 --> 00:46:52.280 position:63%
8pm.

00:46:54.080 --> 00:46:55.880 position:63%
Maribel joins other families who,

00:46:56.080 --> 00:46:56.480 position:63%
like her,

00:46:57.000 --> 00:46:59.160 position:63%
are hoping for the release of their loved ones.

00:46:59.680 --> 00:47:01.440 position:63%
We follow her with a discreet camera.

00:47:02.880 --> 00:47:05.520 position:63%
Have they arrived yet?
- No.

00:47:07.440 --> 00:47:11.440 position:63%
How many are they releasing this evening?
- There are usually 13 of them.

00:47:14.640 --> 00:47:17.560 position:63%
Each time Maribel cherishes the hope of seeing her son again,

00:47:17.880 --> 00:47:19.240 position:63%
some prisoners start to leave.

00:47:22.200 --> 00:47:27.200 position:63%
Most were men at the end of their sentences or arrested without any evidence.

00:47:28.240 --> 00:47:31.840 position:63%
Be careful, Dad.
- I was beaten up.

00:47:32.000 --> 00:47:37.040 position:63%
Oh my god, Dad.
My legs hurt. I'm really in a lot of pain.

00:47:38.320 --> 00:47:40.080 position:63%
We're taking you to hospital.

00:47:41.680 --> 00:47:46.080 position:63%
They're savages.
It's very hard to see them leave in this state.

00:47:46.240 --> 00:47:49.840 position:63%
Have you seen his face?!
You can tell he's not a maras!

00:47:50.720 --> 00:47:51.280 position:63%
What will the gang do?

00:47:51.280 --> 00:47:53.440 position:63%
The policeman comes out
of the station and calls out

00:47:53.480 --> 00:47:55.960 position:63%
the names of the other men
who are about to be released.

00:47:57.200 --> 00:48:01.120 position:63%
Mr Nunez... Mr Romero... Mr Alvarez...

00:48:01.400 --> 00:48:01.800 position:63%
Juan Carlos...

00:48:01.800 --> 00:48:03.960 position:63%
In total 15 are released this evening.

00:48:05.480 --> 00:48:06.920 position:63%
But no joy for Marybelle.

00:48:08.480 --> 00:48:11.200 position:63%
And your son?
- No, nothing.

00:48:11.760 --> 00:48:18.720 position:63%
You can imagine, when I see them out and about
like that, I'm inevitably afraid for my son.

00:48:21.040 --> 00:48:22.400 position:63%
It's very difficult.

00:48:22.560 --> 00:48:26.400 position:63%
It's just how justice fails
because of this numbers game.

00:48:27.680 --> 00:48:29.400 position:63%
Mary Bell will go home alone,

00:48:29.960 --> 00:48:32.160 position:63%
convinced that her son is innocent.

00:48:33.000 --> 00:48:36.480 position:63%
The young man could serve two years in prison for nothing,

00:48:36.920 --> 00:48:38.320 position:63%
and he's far from alone.

00:48:42.000 --> 00:48:42.760 position:63%
For several months,

00:48:43.000 --> 00:48:45.160 position:63%
NGOs have been warning
of thousands of random

00:48:45.200 --> 00:48:47.840 position:63%
arrests and human rights
violations in El Salvador.

00:48:50.920 --> 00:48:52.800 position:63%
In April 2022,

00:48:52.880 --> 00:48:55.480 position:63%
Amnesty International's
Director for the Americas

00:48:55.520 --> 00:48:58.680 position:63%
sounded the alarm in an
open letter to President Buquil.

00:49:09.520 --> 00:49:11.320 position:63%
We asked the Minister of Justice about this,

00:49:11.400 --> 00:49:14.920 position:63%
but he is taking responsibility for potential blunders.

00:49:17.600 --> 00:49:21.920 position:63%
If someone says they're innocent, neither you
nor I can say whether they really are.

00:49:22.320 --> 00:49:30.160 position:63%
And in no judicial system, in no police force
in the world, do they only catch guilty people.

00:49:30.960 --> 00:49:39.760 position:63%
If the work we're doing can restore hope to an entire
people, then it's worth it, it's worth the effort.

00:49:40.080 --> 00:49:45.040 position:63%
So we'll carry on doing what we're doing,
again and again.

00:49:46.440 --> 00:49:47.760 position:63%
Innocent people imprisoned,

00:49:48.000 --> 00:49:48.960 position:63%
according to the minister,

00:49:49.520 --> 00:49:53.960 position:63%
is the price to pay for putting an end to the violence that had overtaken the country.

00:49:54.760 --> 00:49:57.360 position:63%
And to show the whole world that El Salvador has changed,

00:49:57.760 --> 00:50:00.040 position:63%
the president is working on improving its image.

00:50:01.520 --> 00:50:03.160 position:63%
And he is paying the price.

00:50:09.200 --> 00:50:09.960 position:63%
Miss Vietnam,

00:50:11.360 --> 00:50:12.360 position:63%
Miss El Salvador,

00:50:13.760 --> 00:50:14.600 position:63%
Miss Bulgaria,

00:50:15.040 --> 00:50:16.680 position:63%
Miss Egypt and Nicaragua.

00:50:17.560 --> 00:50:18.480 position:63%
There are 16 of them.

00:50:19.360 --> 00:50:21.600 position:63%
And they have come
from the four corners of the

00:50:21.640 --> 00:50:23.880 position:63%
world to compete in the
Miss Universe contest.

00:50:31.120 --> 00:50:33.520 position:63%
a golden opportunity for El Salvador.

00:50:34.560 --> 00:50:35.280 position:63%
The competition,

00:50:35.440 --> 00:50:37.200 position:63%
broadcast in 66 countries,

00:50:37.760 --> 00:50:40.240 position:63%
attracts 500 million television viewers,

00:50:41.320 --> 00:50:43.880 position:63%
so the government is pulling out all the stops it has invested

00:50:44.360 --> 00:50:46.400 position:63%
$100 million in the event.

00:50:53.240 --> 00:50:54.160 position:63%
For this photoshoot,

00:50:54.400 --> 00:50:55.800 position:63%
which will be seen the world over,

00:50:56.200 --> 00:50:59.120 position:63%
a luxury hotel in an incredible location.

00:51:00.080 --> 00:51:01.040 position:63%
Lake Coatepecay,

00:51:01.640 --> 00:51:05.200 position:63%
recognized as one of the most beautiful in the world in the heart of the volcano,

00:51:05.880 --> 00:51:07.720 position:63%
a little paradise that
the contestants were

00:51:07.760 --> 00:51:10.000 position:63%
quick to share with their
thousands of followers.

00:51:11.680 --> 00:51:12.720 position:63%
Hello everyone!

00:51:12.880 --> 00:51:17.440 position:63%
We're at Lake Coatepeque,
and look how beautiful it is!

00:51:18.120 --> 00:51:19.640 position:63%
In the space of just a few days,

00:51:20.040 --> 00:51:23.080 position:63%
the contestants become El Salvador's best ambassadors,

00:51:25.240 --> 00:51:26.920 position:63%
whose attractions they are promoting.

00:51:28.880 --> 00:51:33.600 position:63%
I feel really safe.
It's the safest country in Central America.

00:51:33.760 --> 00:51:37.600 position:63%
And I'm very happy to see how safe it is.

00:51:37.600 --> 00:51:38.440 position:63%
Being here,

00:51:38.440 --> 00:51:39.640 position:63%
it feels very safe.

00:51:39.840 --> 00:51:43.800 position:63%
The government has done an amazing job and I really respect them for that,

00:51:44.480 --> 00:51:48.880 position:63%
for bringing the face of El Salvador to another level.

00:51:49.240 --> 00:51:50.480 position:63%
It was an amazing job done.

00:51:53.360 --> 00:51:56.480 position:63%
A successful communications operation for the authorities.

00:51:56.880 --> 00:52:00.080 position:63%
Perhaps these heavenly
images will make El Salvador

00:52:00.080 --> 00:52:03.280 position:63%
the new fashionable
destination in Latin America.

00:52:03.680 --> 00:52:05.120 position:63%
Get me a paddle.

00:52:05.960 --> 00:52:07.120 position:63%
At least that's what Manolo,

00:52:07.160 --> 00:52:08.640 position:63%
the owner of this luxury hotel,

00:52:08.640 --> 00:52:09.400 position:63%
is hoping for.

00:52:09.440 --> 00:52:13.200 position:63%
It could be great exposure for us on the world stage.

00:52:13.360 --> 00:52:18.960 position:63%
Thanks to this kind of event, we'll be able
to compete with any other tourist destination.

00:52:20.720 --> 00:52:22.480 position:63%
And thank goodness everything went so well today!

00:52:25.680 --> 00:52:26.240 position:63%
The next day,

00:52:26.680 --> 00:52:30.600 position:63%
the Miss Universe election was held in this brand new gymnasium.

00:52:31.680 --> 00:52:36.160 position:63%
450 journalists from all over the world flocked to cover the event.

00:52:40.920 --> 00:52:42.680 position:63%
And there's no risk of spoiling the party.

00:52:44.240 --> 00:52:46.520 position:63%
A huge security detail has been put in place.

00:52:49.000 --> 00:52:52.480 position:63%
Nearly 700 police officers and just as many soldiers.

00:52:53.200 --> 00:52:55.240 position:63%
Because the global visibility of the event...

00:52:55.760 --> 00:52:57.760 position:63%
is not just of interest to the government.

00:53:00.560 --> 00:53:01.880 position:63%
Less than two kilometers away,

00:53:02.480 --> 00:53:08.560 position:63%
Freedom! Freedom!
We don't defend criminals!

00:53:09.520 --> 00:53:11.600 position:63%
a completely different parade took place.

00:53:12.720 --> 00:53:16.080 position:63%
May we present Miss Random Arrest!

00:53:16.240 --> 00:53:18.800 position:63%
And here comes Miss Torture!

00:53:18.960 --> 00:53:21.680 position:63%
We defend innocent people!

00:53:22.560 --> 00:53:24.320 position:63%
Nearly 1,000 people had gathered.

00:53:24.880 --> 00:53:29.040 position:63%
heading for the gymnasium to alert the world to the unfair arrests.

00:53:29.920 --> 00:53:34.320 position:63%
The Miss Universes must see
the true face of EI Salvador!

00:53:36.560 --> 00:53:43.680 position:63%
We're all here because we have a relative,
an innocent friend who's locked up in a prison!

00:53:48.240 --> 00:53:48.440 position:63%
Among

00:53:48.480 --> 00:53:50.200 position:63%
the demonstrators was Mary Bell,

00:53:51.960 --> 00:53:54.240 position:63%
who had also come to demand her son's release.

00:53:55.520 --> 00:53:59.760 position:63%
Demonstrating is the only way
we can make ourselves heard,

00:53:59.920 --> 00:54:02.480 position:63%
because the authorities are not listening to us.

00:54:02.640 --> 00:54:10.000 position:63%
We want the international media to know what
the people of El Salvador are going through.

00:54:10.160 --> 00:54:12.640 position:63%
It's real torture!

00:54:14.720 --> 00:54:17.360 position:63%
But less than 300 meters
from the gymnasium are

00:54:17.400 --> 00:54:20.440 position:63%
the riot police equipped
with two armored vehicles.

00:54:23.040 --> 00:54:27.360 position:63%
All these people represent the innocents!
Let us through!

00:54:28.720 --> 00:54:33.520 position:63%
Are we free or not in this country?!
If it really is a free country, let us through!

00:54:34.080 --> 00:54:38.160 position:63%
Yes, you're free to go left or right,
but you can't go straight on!

00:54:40.440 --> 00:54:42.280 position:63%
The demonstrators are forced to stop here.

00:54:42.760 --> 00:54:45.000 position:63%
The international press will not hear their anger.

00:54:47.600 --> 00:54:53.760 position:63%
I've been getting up every morning for 18 months
praying that my son would come back to me.

00:54:53.920 --> 00:54:56.680 position:63%
And I know that one day, we'll be heard.

00:54:58.600 --> 00:54:59.080 position:63%
In the gym,

00:54:59.120 --> 00:55:00.080 position:63%
the party goes on.

00:55:06.400 --> 00:55:09.360 position:63%
And no one has any idea of the struggle these families are facing.

00:55:13.920 --> 00:55:14.480 position:63%
That evening,

00:55:14.720 --> 00:55:16.760 position:63%
the crown went to Miss Nicaragua.

00:55:22.520 --> 00:55:29.280 position:63%
But the real winner is him.

00:55:30.280 --> 00:55:32.800 position:63%
Nayib Bukele brings the ceremony to a close.

00:55:33.320 --> 00:55:36.920 position:63%
in front of nearly 500 million television viewers around the world.

00:55:41.240 --> 00:55:45.920 position:63%
El Salvador has changed forever and we have demonstrated it here once again.

00:55:46.560 --> 00:55:49.160 position:63%
Welcome to the rebirth of our country.

00:55:49.640 --> 00:55:50.840 position:63%
Welcome to El Salvador.

00:55:56.760 --> 00:55:59.520 position:63%
On 9 February 2024,

00:55:59.560 --> 00:56:04.640 position:63%
Nabi Burele was officially re-elected to govern the country for a further five years.

